163
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:07,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, time to go.</font>

164
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:12,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, that's right. <i>Kinto Un</i>'s gone...</font>

165
00:13:12,490 --> 00:13:16,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now what do I do...?
I wonder if it's too far to run?</font>

166
00:13:16,660 --> 00:13:20,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! I wonder if he's got
any of those capsule thingies!</font>

167
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:35,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He does!</font>

168
00:13:35,010 --> 00:13:39,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I dunno what's what.</font>

169
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:42,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I guess I'll just throw them one
at a time and see what happens.</font>

170
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:56,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hi.</font>

171
00:13:56,010 --> 00:13:58,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What are you?</font>

172
00:13:58,110 --> 00:14:02,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is it not obvious? I am a robot.</font>

173
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:05,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You sure are strange...</font>

174
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you need something?</font>

175
00:14:06,950 --> 00:14:10,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um, well, I wanna go
in that direction, but...</font>

176
00:14:10,550 --> 00:14:13,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then go.</font>

177
00:14:13,290 --> 00:14:17,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, but it looks super far away,
so I want something to ride.</font>

178
00:14:17,130 --> 00:14:21,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Try throwing capsule #3.</font>

179
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:24,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This?</font>

180
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:40,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is this an airplane? I can't ride that.</font>

181
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:43,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can pilot it.</font>

182
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:47,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm saved!</font>

183
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:52,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But this is kind of
slower than <i>Kinto Un</i>...</font>

184
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:55,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is that?</font>

185
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Reporting, sir! Something is
happening with the Dragon Ball</font>

186
00:14:57,940 --> 00:15:00,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Colonel Silver is looking for!</font>

187
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:04,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please observe.</font>

188
00:15:04,310 --> 00:15:07,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Dragon Ball Colonel Silver is
responsible for is heading north,</font>

189
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:12,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">directly toward the Dragon Ball
that General White is in charge of.</font>

190
00:15:12,860 --> 00:15:14,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Call Silver.</font>

191
00:15:19,930 --> 00:15:23,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Isn't it sort of cold?</font>

192
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:27,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I am a robot, so I am not cold.</font>

193
00:15:27,170 --> 00:15:29,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'm shivering...</font>

194
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:49,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Silver here.</font>

195
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:54,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Somebody with a radar
even more sensitive than ours?!</font>

196
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? And they're that strong?!</font>

197
00:15:56,990 --> 00:16:00,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So how many of them were there?!</font>

198
00:16:00,620 --> 00:16:02,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just one kid?!</font>

199
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:19,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Who could it possibly be?
--I do not know.</font>

200
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:22,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But if they could do that
to somebody like Silver...</font>

201
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:24,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...then we cannot afford to be careless.</font>

202
00:16:24,290 --> 00:16:26,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please forgive me for
saying so, Commander Red,</font>

203
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:28,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but this <i>is</i> the work of just one kid.</font>

204
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:30,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He isn't one of our enemies.</font>

205
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hope so.</font>

206
00:16:34,820 --> 00:16:40,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Contact General White. Tell him
to kill the kid and take his ball!</font>

207
00:16:40,410 --> 00:16:42,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Understood!</font>

208
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:45,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--And one other thing.
--Yes, sir.</font>

209
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:48,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bring Colonel Silver to me!</font>

210
00:16:55,090 --> 00:16:58,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-So cold... W-Why is it so cold...?</font>

211
00:16:58,830 --> 00:17:03,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is obvious. The north is cold.</font>

212
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:07,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I don't have any
other clothes to wear...</font>

213
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:12,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Humans are so inefficient.
They get hot, they get cold...</font>

214
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:16,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This spot's fine. L-Land the plane.</font>

215
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:22,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's the matter?! Hey!</font>

216
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, are you listening?!</font>

217
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:27,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Cold!</font>

218
00:17:27,150 --> 00:17:32,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have frozen...</font>

219
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:35,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! We're gonna crash
into the mountains!</font>

220
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:57,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What was that sound?!</font>

221
00:17:58,210 --> 00:18:00,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Looks like something crash-landed!</font>

222
00:18:00,250 --> 00:18:01,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's check it out.</font>

223
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:32,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no use for excuses.</font>

224
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:36,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander, please, wait!
Give me one more chance!</font>

225
00:18:36,350 --> 00:18:41,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Silver. Have you forgotten our rules?</font>

226
00:18:43,490 --> 00:18:49,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why?! You thought highly
of my abilities! So why?!</font>

227
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:55,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Take him away.
--Yes, sir!</font>

228
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't touch me!</font>

229
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:33,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! A plane crash?!</font>

230
00:19:33,710 --> 00:19:37,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it! Are you certain
it's one of our planes?!</font>

231
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:39,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no doubt about it!</font>

232
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:43,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">According to HQ, there should
have been a kid in it!</font>

233
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:47,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see no corpses or anything of the sort.</font>

234
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:50,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just wreckage from a robot soldier!</font>

235
00:19:50,930 --> 00:19:53,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He may have fled. Search for him!</font>

236
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:56,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He should have a Dragon Ball.</font>

237
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

238
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:05,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't know who he is,
but he's one foolish kid.</font>

239
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:07,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! C-Come take a look at this!</font>

240
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:09,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's up? Did you find something?</font>

241
00:20:09,750 --> 00:20:11,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This is...</font>

242
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:29,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>How will Goku stand up</i>
<i>to the Red Ribbon Army,</i></font>

243
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:34,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>which will use all its might to</i>
<i>try to steal the Dragon Ball?!</i></font>

244
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:39,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>And this little girl; is she friend-- or foe?</i></font>

245
00:20:56,690 --> 00:20:59,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

246
00:20:56,690 --> 00:20:59,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

247
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:02,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

248
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:02,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

249
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:08,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

250
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:08,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

251
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:11,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

252
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:11,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

253
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:14,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

254
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:14,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

255
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:20,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

256
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:20,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

257
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:26,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

258
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:26,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

259
00:21:26,260 --> 00:21:32,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

260
00:21:26,260 --> 00:21:32,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

261
00:21:32,430 --> 00:21:43,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

262
00:21:32,430 --> 00:21:43,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

263
00:21:43,570 --> 00:21:51,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

264
00:21:43,570 --> 00:21:51,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

265
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:55,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

266
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:55,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

267
00:21:55,620 --> 00:22:02,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

268
00:21:55,620 --> 00:22:02,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

269
00:22:02,990 --> 00:22:11,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

270
00:22:02,990 --> 00:22:11,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

